_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"c38f22c9b2f00359679bc0b903b40947c9eeaa6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RobotLocomotion/drake/commits/c38f22c9b2f00359679bc0b903b40947c9eeaa6e","html_url":"https://github.com/RobotLocomotion/drake/commit/c38f22c9b2f00359679bc0b903b40947c9eeaa6e"}]},{"sha":"2bd7cc5aadfe3cb5bd72f3733116ba24c4592ea1","node_id":"C_kwDOAPgMkNoAKDJiZDdjYzVhYWRmZTNjYjViZDcyZjM3MzMxMTZiYTI0YzQ1OTJlYTE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Sean Curtis","email":"sean.curtis@tri.global","date":"2023-04-17T19:06:14Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2023-04-17T19:06:14Z"},"message":"QueryObject allows signed distance between a filtered geometry pair (#19176)\n\nHistorically, requesting signed distance between two geometries that had\nbeen filtered would throw. While it might make sense to have the geometries\nfiltered for contact, it might still be convenient to know how far they\nare. This changes the API to allow the caller to demand that collision\nfilters be ignored.","tree":{"sha":"998ce4478b97de19452d271a3541e8607e5e9677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RobotLocomotion/drake/git/trees/998ce4478b97de19452d271a3541e8607e5e9677"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RobotLocomotion/drake/git/commits/2bd7cc5aadfe3cb5bd72f3733116ba24c4592ea1","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJkPZimCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAg14IABXRUVFnLVKwoLmcTOOwzGve\nClOQ5QnE4K1ZlopHn3UxhdzRnWCCaH7pwy+45kJm2RN99jH/7wx7d/llMk8LALBC\n/FSCyg2YtW5NDFgA2VFBYPDMq93YvtjCEA3N8RC7WHUUQL4863zEJih6khwSSJBV\nJf0YEz4IijPF2PP51p+PbjbCR8pWiTLI6uWxwRu3aIcYX1C2X3cljJ0Cm9bJrFAF\nBILdG9ylk2bm0nzcTX1eUQXr18h0wY0LQmrCcjOax+/3+Li1F/bS8gvrjlbzyOP/\n5hmG/L5w8OXYxeQ2RkRJqzGQTrsS0IqDiJiTaYiZDaoG4fYlX3Cl/cCHjDyuF/Q=\n=T4KF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 998ce4478b97de19452d271a3541e8607e5e9677\nparent edb1eb01b8ee35be8bb45e9cd86f2ed5bf1e2538\nauthor Sean Curtis <sean.curtis@tri.global> 1681758374 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1681758374 -0700\n\nQueryObject allows signed distance between a filtered geometry pair (#19176)\n\nHistorically, requesting signed distance between two geometries that had\nbeen filtered would throw. While it might make sense to have the geometries\nfiltered for contact, it might still be convenient to know how far they\nare. This changes the API to allow the caller to demand that collision\nfilters be ignored.","verified_at":"2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RobotLocomotion/drake/commits/2bd7cc5aadfe3cb5bd72f3733116ba24c4592ea1","html_url":"https://github.com/RobotLocomotion/drake/commit/2bd7cc5aadfe3cb5bd72f3733116ba24c4592ea1","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RobotLocomotion/drake/commits/2bd7cc5aadfe3cb5bd72f3733116ba24c4592ea1/comments","author":{"login":"SeanCurtis-TRI","id":22159799,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTU5Nzk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22159799?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeanCurtis-TRI","html_url":"https://github.com/SeanCurtis-TRI","foll